<title>FRANCE: France selects Indosuez for Air France sale - paper.</title>
<headline>France selects Indosuez for Air France sale - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French government has selected Banque Indosuez as its financial adviser for the pending privatisation of Air France, L'Agefi newspaper said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Finance and Economy Ministry was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>L'Agefi said Indosuez, controlled by Caisse Nationale du Credit Agricole, had been selected over Societe Generale, NatWest and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p>Air France has Lazard Brothers as its financial advisers.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
